# Songbirds in a Snowstorm (crystalWar 51): a level 99 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria [S] with Bonds That Never Die and
# the WotG mission The Will of the World completed (GMs; the WotG mission then The Scent of Battle, which answers none
# of these NPCs and zones; the other logs as group 1's flows). Bonds' 650 sets this quest's Timer (tomorrow) and
# mustZone: set here by GMs. The Timer 99999: Rholont: nil (32); the Timer today (8000) and the mustZone 80: nil (32);
# out to Garlaige Citadel [S] and back (the mustZone cleared: another zone): Prog 0: 113, finished: Prog 1. Prog 1,
# Option 0: 655, finished: Option 1; again: 49. Daigraffeaux 114, finished: begun. Rholont (accepted): 656. Beaucedine
# Glacier [S] at Prog 1: 1, left open: an update on option 0 (nothing), one on option 11 (0, 23, 1756, 0, 0, 5832718, 0,
# 1), finished: Prog 2. Colossal Footprint 2, finished: Prog 3; Prog 3, no key items: nil (NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY).
# Rocky Perch: Prog 3: NONDESCRIPT_MASS, a Goliath Worm. The Lance Fish, Paladin Lobster and Scutum Crab (GMs: fished at
# the zone's ponds; no script gives them): the Footprint 3 (136), finished: Prog 4. Charred Firewood, a Flint Stone: 4,
# finished: Prog 5 (the flint kept). Compressed Snow 5, finished: Prog 6; 27, finished: the Orcish Bloodletter spawned,
# claimed (scripted: not up at zone load); the NM up: nil (NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY). The NM killed at Prog 6: Prog 7.
# Compressed Snow 6, finished: completed (an Icarus Wing). Southern San d'Oria [S]: Rholont: Blood of Heroes' available
# 656.
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Rholont/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/Daigraffeaux/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/113 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/114 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/655 BeaucedineGlacierS/onZoneIn/1 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventUpdate/1 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/1 BeaucedineGlacierS/Colossal_Footprint/onTrigger BeaucedineGlacierS/Rocky_Perch/onTrigger BeaucedineGlacierS/Charred_Firewood/onTrade BeaucedineGlacierS/Compressed_Snow/onTrigger BeaucedineGlacierS/Orcish_Bloodletter/onMobDeath BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/2 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/3 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/4 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/5 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/6 BeaucedineGlacierS/onEventFinish/27
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=-167.043,-2,55.484 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.BondsThatNeverDie completed
mission Wotg TheWillOfTheWorld completed
mission Wotg TheScentOfBattle current
